How to Start Your First SIP

Want to start investing but don’t know where to begin?

@groww_official 
@upstox.pro 
@zerodhaonline 
@angelone 

This simple guide explains how to start your first SIP in India, step by step.

Learn the basics of a Systematic Investment Plan (SIP), decide how much you can invest, complete your KYC, select a mutual fund suited to your goals and risk tolerance, and set up your monthly investment. Start with an amount you can afford and understand the risks before investing. Mutual fund returns are not guaranteed.

